<!doctype html><html lang="zh-CN"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><meta http-equiv="Content-Security-Policy" content="default-src 'none'; style-src 'sha256-UvG7JR3vH2jtAeJ4GgAaoRKrB6V0IeA15sUtLkIS7Yk='; base-uri 'none'; form-action 'none'"><title>短剧越来越常见之后，谁得到收益？</title><style>
:root{color-scheme:light;--ink:#172f42;--muted:#526675;--line:#d9e1e3;--accent:#126456;--paper:#ffffff;--wash:#f2f5f4}
*{box-sizing:border-box}html{scroll-behavior:smooth}body{margin:0;background:var(--wash);color:var(--ink);font:17px/1.85 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Noto Sans CJK SC","Microsoft YaHei",sans-serif}
